---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="PolicyLens Terms of Service - Read our terms and conditions for using our privacy policy analysis service."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Terms of <span class="gradient-text">Service</span></h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 10, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="toc">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#acceptance">Acceptance of Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#service">Our Service</a></li>
          <li><a href="#use-terms">Acceptable Use</a></li>
          <li><a href="#intellectual-property">Intellectual Property</a></li>
          <li><a href="#user-content">User Content</a></li>
          <li><a href="#third-party">Third-Party Content</a></li>
          <li><a href="#disclaimers">Disclaimers</a></li>
          <li><a href="#limitation">Limitation of Liability</a></li>
          <li><a href="#indemnification">Indemnification</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changes">Changes to Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#governing-law">Governing Law</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="acceptance">
        <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using PolicyLens ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not access or use the Service.</p>
        <p>By using the Service, you represent and warrant that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>You are at least 18 years of age, or you have the consent of a parent or guardian</li>
          <li>You have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms</li>
          <li>You will use the Service in accordance with these Terms</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="service">
        <h2>Our Service</h2>
        <p>PolicyLens provides a privacy policy and terms of service analysis tool. The Service allows users to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Analyze privacy policies and terms of service documents</li>
          <li>View risk assessments and breakdowns of legal documents</li>
          <li>Compare multiple policies side-by-side</li>
          <li>Access analysis history stored locally in their browser</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue the Service at any time without prior notice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="use-terms">
        <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree NOT to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Service in any way that violates applicable laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Service</li>
          <li>Use the Service to process or analyze documents for illegal purposes</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service or servers connected to the Service</li>
          <li>Introduce viruses, trojan horses, worms, or other malicious code</li>
          <li>Use automated systems to access the Service without prior written permission</li>
          <li>Collect information about other users without their consent</li>
          <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="intellectual-property">
        <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The Service and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by PolicyLens and are protected by international copyright, trademark, patent, and other intellectual property laws.</p>
        <p>You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the Service for personal, non-commercial purposes. This license does not include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Any resale or commercial use of the Service</li>
          <li>Derivative works based on the Service</li>
          <li>Use of data mining, robots, or similar data gathering tools</li>
          <li>Removal of proprietary notices</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="user-content">
        <h2>User Content</h2>
        <p>You retain ownership of any content you submit to the Service, including text you paste for analysis. By submitting content, you grant us a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, and process such content solely for the purpose of providing the Service.</p>
        <p>You represent and warrant that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>You own or have the necessary rights to submit the content</li>
          <li>The content does not infringe on the rights of any third party</li>
          <li>The content does not contain malicious code or harmful elements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="third-party">
        <h2>Third-Party Content</h2>
        <p>The Service may include content from third parties, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Analysis results based on publicly available privacy policies</li>
          <li>Advertisements from third-party ad networks</li>
          <li>Links to external websites</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for any third-party content, websites, or services. Your interactions with third parties are governed by their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="disclaimers">
        <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
        <p><strong>THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</strong></p>
        <p>We specifically disclaim all warranties, including but not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement</li>
          <li>Accuracy, completeness, or reliability of analysis results</li>
          <li>Continuous, uninterrupted, or secure access to the Service</li>
          <li>Errors, bugs, or inaccuracies in the Service</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> PolicyLens provides analysis for informational purposes only. Our analysis does not constitute legal advice. Always consult with a qualified attorney for legal matters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="limitation">
        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p><strong>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL POLICYLENS, ITS DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, PARTNERS, AGENTS, SUPPLIERS, OR AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES.</strong></p>
        <p>This includes, without limitation:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Loss of profits, revenue, data, or use</li>
          <li>Cost of substitute services</li>
          <li>Any conduct or content of any third party</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction of your data</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>OUR TOTAL LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED $100 USD OR THE AMOUNT YOU PAID US (IF ANY) IN THE TWELVE MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="indemnification">
        <h2>Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless PolicyLens and its affiliates, licensors, and service providers from any claims, liabilities, damages, judgments, awards, losses, costs, or expenses arising out of or relating to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your use of the Service</li>
          <li>Your violation of these Terms</li>
          <li>Your violation of any rights of a third party</li>
          <li>Any content you submit to the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="changes">
        <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms at any time at our sole discretion. If a revision is material, we will provide at least 30 days' notice prior to any new terms taking effect. What constitutes a material change will be determined at our sole discretion.</p>
        <p>By continuing to access or use the Service after any revisions become effective, you agree to be bound by the revised terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="governing-law">
        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p>
        <p>Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Service shall be resolved in the courts of the United States, and you consent to the personal jurisdiction of such courts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
        <ul class="contact-info">
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> legal@policylens.app</li>
          <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/contact">Contact Form</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 80px 24px 60px;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .toc {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .toc h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .toc ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .toc a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .toc a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 8px 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-section li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 16px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--accent-cyan);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .contact-info {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .contact-info li {
    padding: 12px 0;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .contact-info li::before {
    display: none;
  }
</style>
